<div class="container" style="padding-top: 30px; padding-bottom: 60px;">
  <div class="row">
    <div class="col-xs-12 col-md-10 col-md-offset-1">

      <div class="text-center" style="margin-bottom: 40px;">
        <h1 style="color: #e74c3c; font-weight: bold;">How to Play SportsBeep</h1>
        <p class="lead text-muted">Pick your players. Build your team. Win $BEEP tokens.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="panel panel-default" style="margin-bottom: 25px;">
        <div class="panel-heading" style="background-color: #34495e; color: white;">
          <h3 class="panel-title"><span class="badge" style="background-color: #e74c3c; margin-right: 10px;">1</span> Create Your Account</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="panel-body">
          <p>Sign up for a free SportsBeep account. During registration, you can optionally link your <strong>Cardano wallet address</strong> to receive $BEEP token rewards directly on the blockchain.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Choose a unique username</li>
            <li>Provide your email address</li>
            <li>Optionally add your Cardano wallet address for $BEEP token payouts</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="panel panel-default" style="margin-bottom: 25px;">
        <div class="panel-heading" style="background-color: #34495e; color: white;">
          <h3 class="panel-title"><span class="badge" style="background-color: #e74c3c; margin-right: 10px;">2</span> Browse Available Contests</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="panel-body">
          <p>Check out the available contests for <strong>MLB</strong> and <strong>NFL</strong> games. Each contest has:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Entry Fee</strong> &ndash; The cost to enter (in $BEEP tokens)</li>
            <li><strong>Prize Pool</strong> &ndash; Total prizes available to winners</li>
            <li><strong>Max Entries</strong> &ndash; How many players can join</li>
            <li><strong>Start Time</strong> &ndash; When the contest locks and games begin</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="panel panel-default" style="margin-bottom: 25px;">
        <div class="panel-heading" style="background-color: #34495e; color: white;">
          <h3 class="panel-title"><span class="badge" style="background-color: #e74c3c; margin-right: 10px;">3</span> Build Your Team</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="panel-body">
          <p>Select real players from that day's games to fill your roster. Each contest has position requirements you need to fill:</p>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-6">
              <h4 style="color: #e74c3c;">MLB Roster</h4>
              <ul>
                <li>Pitcher (SP/CP/RP)</li>
                <li>Catcher (C)</li>
                <li>Corner Infielder (1B/3B)</li>
                <li>Middle Infielder (2B/SS)</li>
                <li>Outfielder (LF/CF/RF)</li>
                <li>Flex Player (any position)</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-6">
              <h4 style="color: #e74c3c;">NFL Roster</h4>
              <ul>
                <li>Quarterback (QB)</li>
                <li>Running Back (RB)</li>
                <li>Wide Receiver (WR)</li>
                <li>Tight End (TE)</li>
                <li>Kicker (K)</li>
                <li>Flex Player (any position)</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="panel panel-default" style="margin-bottom: 25px;">
        <div class="panel-heading" style="background-color: #34495e; color: white;">
          <h3 class="panel-title"><span class="badge" style="background-color: #e74c3c; margin-right: 10px;">4</span> Answer Timed Questions</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="panel-body">
          <p>What makes SportsBeep unique is our <strong>timed question system</strong>. After selecting your team, you'll answer sports trivia and prediction questions under time pressure.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Each question has a countdown timer</li>
            <li>Faster correct answers earn more points</li>
            <li>Questions test your sports knowledge and prediction skills</li>
            <li>Your total score combines player performance + question points</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="panel panel-default" style="margin-bottom: 25px;">
        <div class="panel-heading" style="background-color: #34495e; color: white;">
          <h3 class="panel-title"><span class="badge" style="background-color: #e74c3c; margin-right: 10px;">5</span> Track & Win</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="panel-body">
          <p>Once the games start, watch your players rack up points in real time on the leaderboard.</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Live Scoring</strong> &ndash; See your points update as games progress</li>
            <li><strong>Leaderboards</strong> &ndash; Track your ranking against other players</li>
            <li><strong>Payouts</strong> &ndash; Winners receive $BEEP tokens to their wallet</li>
            <li><strong>Blockchain Verified</strong> &ndash; All transactions recorded on Cardano</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="panel panel-default" style="margin-bottom: 25px;">
        <div class="panel-heading" style="background-color: #27ae60; color: white;">
          <h3 class="panel-title">Scoring System</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="panel-body">
          <div class="row">
            <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-6">
              <h4 style="color: #e74c3c;">MLB Batting</h4>
              <table class="table table-condensed table-striped">
                <tr><td>Single</td><td class="text-right"><strong>+1 pt</strong></td></tr>
                <tr><td>Double</td><td class="text-right"><strong>+2 pts</strong></td></tr>
                <tr><td>Triple</td><td class="text-right"><strong>+3 pts</strong></td></tr>
                <tr><td>Home Run</td><td class="text-right"><strong>+4 pts</strong></td></tr>
                <tr><td>RBI</td><td class="text-right"><strong>+1 pt</strong></td></tr>
                <tr><td>Run Scored</td><td class="text-right"><strong>+1 pt</strong></td></tr>
                <tr><td>Walk / HBP</td><td class="text-right"><strong>+1 pt</strong></td></tr>
                <tr><td>Stolen Base</td><td class="text-right"><strong>+2 pts</strong></td></tr>
                <tr><td>Out</td><td class="text-right"><strong>-0.25 pts</strong></td></tr>
              </table>
            </div>
            <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-6">
              <h4 style="color: #e74c3c;">MLB Pitching</h4>
              <table class="table table-condensed table-striped">
                <tr><td>Win</td><td class="text-right"><strong>+4 pts</strong></td></tr>
                <tr><td>Strikeout</td><td class="text-right"><strong>+1 pt</strong></td></tr>
                <tr><td>Inning Pitched</td><td class="text-right"><strong>+1 pt</strong></td></tr>
                <tr><td>Walk (BB)</td><td class="text-right"><strong>-0.25 pts</strong></td></tr>
                <tr><td>Hit Allowed</td><td class="text-right"><strong>-0.25 pts</strong></td></tr>
                <tr><td>ERA</td><td class="text-right"><strong>-1 pt</strong></td></tr>
              </table>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="well text-center" style="background-color: #34495e; color: white; border: none; padding: 30px;">
        <h3>Ready to Play?</h3>
        <p>Create your free account and start competing today!</p>
        <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
          <%= link_to 'Sign Up Now', new_user_registration_path, class: 'btn btn-danger btn-lg', style: 'margin-right: 10px;' %>
          <%= link_to 'Login', new_user_session_path, class: 'btn btn-default btn-lg' %>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</div>
